{"title":"2016 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Interactive_Teaching_Approach)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8cd2459277769586b44326e418ae9bc6b31bba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"13\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09d7f0618e8f525b3ac3348d6b3a29d6c15a4cfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Bigg\\vert\\Big\\vert |x|-x\\Big\\vert-|x|\\Bigg\\vert-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"151\" height=\"54\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/83602f0919b31021a0078aea1ec49824c56c0c08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2016\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2016\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4032\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6048$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"479\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting carefully, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/e/6aebec32227a14fbafaecde95a0d772bb18ede1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Bigg\\vert\\Big\\vert 2016-(-2016)\\Big\\vert-2016\\Bigg\\vert-(-2016)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"290\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p>becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836780eca7b96a649d595c9c4c3beb3719b2b624.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|4032-2016|+2016=2016+2016=4032$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p>Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca1daac7160be6db366a7007c3d2447d3f174b82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-y = x = -2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" /> into the equation. Now, it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/3139cd4cc805278adf3673cce66b8b9c1331a525.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Bigg\\vert\\Big\\vert |y|+y\\Big\\vert-|y|\\Bigg\\vert+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"148\" height=\"54\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c67bafdc7b62e04a558206f16e4bb160a4e02acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" />, it is a positive number, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e16f271c63faecd878fe2ba8c2a2eb121beb8b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|y| = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />. Now the equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8a12e1f0ecefaf9afc847a12e1e87548d35108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Bigg\\vert\\Big\\vert y+y\\Big\\vert-y\\Bigg\\vert+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"128\" height=\"54\" />. This further simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/948d31db4aac4515d60112ce08be211791654bf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y-y+y = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"124\" height=\"15\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c311c950addb6e1b0ff620611b295e3d10d3b1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4032}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"83\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Interactive_Teaching_Approach.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Interactive_Teaching_Approach)\">Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xdyH-S5B0dI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xdyH-S5B0dI</a>\n</p><p>~MathkidsbyMax\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2cPRcI_rIvU\">https://youtu.be/2cPRcI_rIvU</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PuAY2v0bt-0&amp;list=PL9t_YdPye18X63L4lwp9zEu2L9MGopBFe&amp;index=3\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PuAY2v0bt-0&amp;list=PL9t_YdPye18X63L4lwp9zEu2L9MGopBFe&amp;index=3</a>\n~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also<